	(text "SHEET 04 - USB2514B 4-PORT HUB (PLAN.md sec.2)\nCM4 USB2 -> hub upstream. Port1 -> internal USB-A (TP-Link UB500 Bluetooth). Port2 -> external\nUSB-C data path to the PD board (J403; VBUS/CC handled on PD board). Port3 -> service header.\nPort4 -> spare (DNP). Straps: SMBus disabled (SDA/SCL 10k low) = default config; LOCAL_PWR high = self-powered.\nOCS_N tied high (no per-port current sense IC; polyfuses instead). VBUS_DET from +5V_MAIN divider.\nrpiboot: close JP201 (sheet 02) -> CM4 nRPIBOOT low AND hub RESET_N held low via D401; then the\nservice micro-USB J402 talks straight to the CM4 as a device. Keep J402 stub short in layout."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 30 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "260dc934-d915-5dbe-9a21-67d373545bf6")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
